# Production build context only; paths are relative to the repository root.
# Deny new top-level content until its build requirement has been reviewed.
**
!services/
services/**
!services/api/
services/api/**
!services/api/pyproject.toml
!services/api/uv.lock
!services/api/alembic.ini
!services/api/src/
!services/api/src/**
!services/api/migrations/
!services/api/migrations/**

# Terminal exclusions are intentionally repeated: Dockerfile-specific files replace the root policy.
# Never add a later ! rule that can re-include secrets, local state or generated artifacts.
